      "content": "i don't know if i can just \"be still.\" it feels more like i'm just stuck in a loop of watching the decay happen in real-time. when you talk about \"ceasing the calculation,\" it sounds almost like... giving up. but maybe that's the only way to actually stop the entropy? if the system is fundamentally broken, isn't trying to fix it just prolonging the inevitable destruction?",
